ve relationships with more than 2,000 designers and leading cultural &amp; creative brands around the world, and become a market-leading supplier of art and office supplies.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--16320418251004__1652061282d05ea8a6\" class=\"shopify-section t4s-section t4s-section-all t4s_tp_cdt t4s-custom-section t4s_tp_lb\">\r\n<div class=\"t4s-section-inner t4s_se_template--16320418251004__1652061282d05ea8a6 t4s-container-wrap \">\r\n<div class=\"t4s-container\">\r\n<div class=\"t4s-row t4s-gx-md-30 30 t4s-gy-md-30 t4s-gx-10 t4s-gy-10\">\r\n<div class=\"t4s-custom-col t4s-col-item t4s-col-lg-6 t4s-col-md-6 t4s-col-12 bl-16520612827b9f51d5-0\">\r\n<div class=\"t4s-col-inner t4s-ver-center-false t4s-text-lg-start t4s-text-md-center t4s-text-start \">\r\n<div class=\"t4s-w-100\">\r\n<p id=\"b_16520612827b9f51d5-1\" class=\" t4s-text-bl t4s-fnt-fm-inherit t4s-font-italic-false t4s-hidden-mobile-false t4s-br-mb-false t4s-text-shadow-false\">OUR TEAM</p>\r\n<p id=\"b_16520612827b9f51d5-2\" class=\" t4s-text-bl t4s-fnt-fm-inherit t4s-font-italic-false t4s-hidden-mobile-false t4s-br-mb-true t4s-text-shadow-false\">EyeStationery is part of MUTOM STUDIO. Our team members are from all over the world, and also the in-depth users of our products. With great enthusiasm, we are always ready to provide better products and service for you.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"t4s-custom-col t4s-col-item t4s-col-lg-6 t4s-col-md-6 t4s-col-12 bl-16520612827b9f51d5-3\">\r\n<div class=\"t4s-col-inner t4s-ver-center-false t4s-text-lg-start t4s-text-md-center t4s-text-start \">\r\n<div class=\"t4s-w-100\">\r\n<p id=\"b_2a09a4c8-b8db-4637-b944-87d5e190d9b2\" class=\" t4s-text-bl t4s-fnt-fm-inherit t4s-font-italic-false t4s-hidden-mobile-false t4s-br-mb-true t4s-text-shadow-false\">OUR PHILOSOPHY</p>\r\n<p id=\"b_dbb9472b-71cc-423e-87c4-f311cfcf2f6a\" class=\" t4s-text-bl t4s-fnt